Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious dear So tell us, how is soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious dear So tell us, how is soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I did okay, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some more rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really important that you\Neat well for your brain and body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not see it, but you're\Ngrowing all the time, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have another half a bowl, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ken, tomorrow's soccer\Npractice has been postponed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.36,0:02:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This beef stew is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I have some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's chicken parmesan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:02:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just ate too much at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, I just eat one bowl,\Nbut my folks seem concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I eat a little more than I usually do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.66,0:03:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ate more for your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would have ever thought that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, were they happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might have to start\Neating like this every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, there's\Nonly one thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jumping jacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ken! Feel the burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crunch those abs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're jumping up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor, are you having trouble sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because you're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:03:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were just so useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what do you think you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had so much potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, you had a chance for true\Ngreatness to rule in infamy forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you wasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Lee, I'm so tired of lifting this\Npaintbrush that my whole body is shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're quite a drill team, Gekomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, looking good, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was a good day's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We painted everything in sight\Nand some things that weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Davis almost strained his\Nvoice from shouting orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, even with fresh\Npaint and some new roofs,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Primary Village still seems kind of sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe a cute carpenter will come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one shows up, the only\Nplace he's going is to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, volunteer to be his helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that jerk really left the digital\Nworld in a big mess, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, it's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was talking about Ken, not you, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No harm, no foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta wonder, what\Nis he up to now? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.56,0:05:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he just playing with\Nus so we think he's nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if he really is nice, he'd be here\Njust like us, cleaning this place up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.77,0:05:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Ken's not coming back to the\Ndigital world anymore, uh, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One wouldn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't think the Digimon\Ncould forgive him for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sound mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't forgive him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's get back to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starving. Great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, party of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I got a kendo lesson to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll have to\Njust pig out without ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have fun at your lesson. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now what time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is time to munch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check these out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're liquid yogurt packs. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always eat yogurt with a spoon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last week I said, what the\Nheck, and tried it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned that I really prefer drinking my\Nyogurt instead of eating it with a spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A light went on, and I realized we never\Nstop learning if we just keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an interesting lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little lower, Palmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till Davis sees this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll flip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Cat Punzel would let down her\NPersian hair so he could climb up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being flexible is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monomir shoots! He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if this happens again, young man,\Nyou will be talking to the principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What took you so long? Lose your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some teachers are just nitpickers\Nabout such little things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was accidentally playing soccer\Nindoors, and somehow a window broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reynolds sure is a grouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the fourth time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, who's counting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was at least six.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to Primary Village we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Gate, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have new friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they sure weren't here yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because yesterday\Nwe rebuilt the nursery school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a nursery school? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So logic dictates they\Nwere all students there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.57,0:09:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if we restore things\Nto the way they were,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then all of the Digimon\Nwill return as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, so let's keep working.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a major pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, they're cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess not what you said a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vimon, let's give this\Nour best shot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiball! Hmph! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.86,0:10:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.77,0:10:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vimon! Digiball!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:10:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still Vimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess my biorhythm's off today!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ate a ton and you\NDigivolve fine yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me why!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's some kind of digi jet lag.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any chance you\Nate some bad chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe chicken soup might help, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But his stomach's full.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had four TV dinners for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he overate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't fought in so\Nlong that he's rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's totally out of\Nshape when it comes to digivolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad I thought of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just need to relax and do something\Nto take your mind off of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have decided that both of you\Nneed a break from all this hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going back to work\Nwhile the four of us rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't want to say anything,\Nbut I could use a little nap myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to go outside of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to check something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back in about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I could use a little nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I got a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know something we could\Ndo that's really relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No go for Gato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Patamon, you try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, give it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Digivolve, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not amateurs like V-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the control spires had been\Nknocked out of commission when Ken left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this makes me think they\Njust might be active again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon and I are going to get back to\Nwork and finish fixing those water lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how is it Veeamon and\NI end up having to babysit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone has to look after\Nthem, and strange as it sounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they really seem to like you, so\Nwe figured you're the best choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hey! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:13:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You control the ball like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it? It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, V-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now let's play\Na game so you can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass the ball, I'm open!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go after that ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, you're getting the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.32,0:14:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Go! That's it! Use\Nyour head! Outstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told Davis to watch the little ones,\Nthough I'm not sure who's watching whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.56,0:14:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, Davis gets a chance to boss\Naround someone else besides just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, give me the 411.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you able to digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.08,0:14:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.99,0:14:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the control spires are\Nwhat's keeping them from Digivolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we gotta find a\Nway to prove my theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Cody, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, the Emperor sure left a mess here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's been buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we got a lot to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we better get started, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, let's get to\Nwork, Digmon. Dig it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Thundermon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a highly charged\NDigimon who's electrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's shocking about this pint-sized
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powerhouse is that he packs\Na 10 million volt wallop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he attacking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not being directed by a control\Nspire or wearing a dark ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if we should fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous, he's\Nattacking us for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we haven't done anything, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiloland! Armagellomon Digiball 2
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.48,0:16:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on Golemon, a champion Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.32,0:17:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My whole body is surrounded\Nby super-strained steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.58,0:17:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotten evildoers with\Nmy Megaton Press attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the iron balls that\Nshoot from my tail hammer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will definitely put a\Ndent in any enemy's plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I digivolve, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Femon can't digiball, but\Nyou're at the champion level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.90,0:17:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I think we'd\Nbetter go above ground now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, you'd better take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, and Golemon don't\Ntell me you're gonna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just gonna drive him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one that caught me, who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.26,0:18:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.12,0:18:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're both fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good news, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Cody, is that Digmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Armadimon at the champion level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that Digimon up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That big green one helped us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, he really saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.06,0:18:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flaking strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did he just do to Thundermon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.00,0:18:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was vaporized.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, up there! Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing in the Digi-World?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Wormmon can Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Wormmon saved Cody, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really just doesn't\Nadd up. Here comes the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe this.\NWhat you know that controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fire that was up on the\Nridge guess what it's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.31,0:19:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How? When?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why Armadimon was able to digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.60,0:19:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Wormmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.90,0:20:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let her get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.61,0:20:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, I won't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.24,0:20:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't figure it\Nout What was his angle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did Ken help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kendo isn't just doing the\Nsame move over and over. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her heart. Your mind, your technique.\NYou need to be softer, more fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensei, you mean more like\Nthat liquid yogurt? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's another way to look at this lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did Ken help the Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is the mysterious woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out on the next\NDigimon Digital Monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not too young!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
